You mount a grenade launcher on your steamgun that launches high explosive rounds. Each time you make a basic attack with your steamgun or a heavy weapon, you fire a grenade at the target that explodes for [104%, 123%, 137%, 149%, 160% (TL1-5)] steamgun damage in radius [1, 1, 1, 2, 2 (TL1-5)].

This talent also reinforces the armor of you and your minions to give you immunity to your own grenades.

You can only fire a single grenade once every 9 turns.
